{"term":{"label":"道","occurrences":15,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"6B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-ii","title":"告子下","description":"任人有問屋廬子曰：「禮與食孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n「色與禮孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n曰：「以禮食，則飢而死；不以禮食，則得食，必以禮乎？親迎，則不得妻；不親迎，則得妻，必親迎乎！」\n屋廬子不能對，明日之鄒以告孟子。孟子曰：「於答是也何有？不揣其本而齊其末，方寸之木可使高於岑樓。金重於羽者，豈謂一鉤金與一輿羽之謂哉？取食之"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"三","id":"三"},{"form":"今","id":"今"},{"form":"君","id":"君"},{"form":"堯","id":"堯"},{"form":"大","id":"大"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"孝","id":"孝"},{"form":"小","id":"小"},{"form":"桀","id":"桀"},{"form":"欲","id":"欲"},{"form":"民","id":"民"},{"form":"水","id":"水"},{"form":"舜","id":"舜"},{"form":"行","id":"行"},{"form":"道","id":"道"},{"form":"重","id":"重"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.9324267987180264,"source":"民","target":"堯"},{"weight":2.220108871169807,"source":"民","target":"舜"},{"weight":1.9969653198555974,"source":"民","target":"今"},{"weight":1.9324267987180264,"source":"道","target":"堯"},{"weight":2.220108871169807,"source":"道","target":"孝"},{"weight":2.220108871169807,"source":"道","target":"舜"},{"weight":1.814643763061643,"source":"道","target":"大"},{"weight":0.42834940194175225,"source":"道","target":"三"},{"weight":0.7731898882334817,"source":"道","target":"子"},{"weight":1.1786549963416462,"source":"道","target":"君"},{"weight":0.2052058506275425,"source":"道","target":"今"},{"weight":1.6604930832343845,"source":"道","target":"小"},{"weight":1.526961690609862,"source":"道","target":"欲"},{"weight":1.303818139295652,"source":"道","target":"桀"},{"weight":0.7160314743935331,"source":"道","target":"重"},{"weight":1.814643763061643,"source":"道","target":"水"},{"weight":0.515360778931382,"source":"道","target":"行"},{"weight":3.1363996030439623,"source":"堯","target":"舜"},{"weight":2.6255739792779718,"source":"堯","target":"孝"},{"weight":0.4855078157817008,"source":"堯","target":"子"},{"weight":0.9208258870395463,"source":"堯","target":"行"},{"weight":1.526961690609862,"source":"堯","target":"大"},{"weight":2.065958191342549,"source":